  "description": "When Hallyu sensation Yoon Ga-Eul suddenly announces her retirement, it's a disaster for her management as they scramble to save both their own careers and hers. But Ga-Eul doesn't care about her acting career, the broken contracts, or even the penalty fees. What's most important to her now is getting to live a real life and finding someone who will finally take her side. And when she finds herself living under the same roof as a pair of bickering brothers, she may have just landed in the right hands. \n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
